  "text": "# Executable hyperbolic and inverse hyperbolic operators in a periodic Fourier-mode source.\ndomain ThermalDomain {\n    grid       = 32 × 32\n    extent     = 1m × 1m\n    boundaries = Periodic\n}\n\nmodel HeatEquation on ThermalDomain {\n    const diffusivity = 0.01m²/s\n    field temperature: Scalar<Kelvin>\n\n    dynamics {\n        ∂ₜtemperature = diffusivity ∇²temperature + 1K/s * (sinh(asinh(sin(2πx / 1m))) + (cosh(acosh(2)) - 1) * sin(2πx / 1m) + 2 * tanh(atanh(sin(2πx / 1m) / 2)) + (sinh(1) / sinh(1)) * sin(2πx / 1m) + (cosh(1) / cosh(1)) * sin(2πx / 1m))\n    }\n    initial {\n        temperature = 300K\n    }\n}\n\nsolver ThermalSolver for HeatEquation {\n    spatial {\n        method    = FiniteDifference\n        diffusion = CentralDifference\n    }\n    temporal {\n        method   = RungeKuttaSecondOrder\n        timeStep = 10⁻⁴s\n    }\n}\n\nlet simulation = HeatEquation ▷ ThermalSolver ▷ Evolve(until: 0.01s)\n\nsimulation\n    ▷ Observe {\n        meanTemperature     = Mean(temperature)\n        temperatureVariance = Mean((temperature − meanTemperature)²)\n    }\n    ▷ Visualize {\n        temperature         = Heatmap\n        temperatureVariance = LineGraph\n    }\n"
