  "text": "# Nonlocal parabolic PDE: live mean-field feedback is evaluated at both RK2 stages.\n# The spatial mean relaxes to 295 K while the Fourier mode diffuses independently.\ndomain ThermalDomain {\n    grid       = 32 × 32\n    extent     = 1m × 1m\n    boundaries = Periodic\n}\n\nmodel HeatEquation on ThermalDomain {\n    const diffusivity       = 0.01m²/s\n    const reactionRate      = 2s⁻¹\n    const ambientTemperature = 295K\n    field temperature: Scalar<Kelvin>\n\n    dynamics {\n        ∂ₜtemperature = diffusivity ∇²temperature − reactionRate * (mean(temperature) − ambientTemperature)\n    }\n    initial {\n        temperature = 300K + 10K * sin(2πx / 1m)\n    }\n}\n\nsolver ThermalSolver for HeatEquation {\n    spatial {\n        method    = FiniteDifference\n        diffusion = CentralDifference\n    }\n    temporal {\n        method   = RungeKuttaSecondOrder\n        timeStep = 10⁻⁴s\n    }\n}\n\nlet simulation = HeatEquation ▷ ThermalSolver ▷ Evolve(until: 0.01s)\n\nsimulation\n    ▷ Observe {\n        meanTemperature     = Mean(temperature)\n        temperatureVariance = Mean((temperature − meanTemperature)²)\n    }\n    ▷ Visualize {\n        temperature         = Heatmap\n        temperatureVariance = LineGraph\n    }\n"
